# ROUTE HEADERS -- pipe-separated. Columns:
#   route_id | name | era | domain | target | notes
# era: ancient | alchemical | 1700s | 1800s | 1900s | modern
# The FEEDSTOCK / INTERMEDIATE / PRODUCT split is NOT declared here. It is derived
# from route_steps.psv by tools/build_catalog.py: a species consumed but never
# produced inside the route is a primary feedstock; one both produced and consumed
# is an intermediate; one produced and never consumed is a product or byproduct.
# Declaring it would let the declaration drift from the steps; deriving it cannot.
